{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "c62aa11d0963bc92a503d876f338e8bb7824a3b78b0282048460275e3f8af310", "ja": "みんなの宿題", "zh": "大家的作业", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ed9aa87651b25d744887158c66b6d2ad725a4a892cc9d7a7f7cc280fb7acfa5e", "ja": "レッスンにやってきた伊織と春香。別の仕事\nが終わり、今から参加するとのこと。感心す\nる星梨花とエミリー。数日後、公演までに特\n別な演出をみんなで考えてみようという話に\nなり、やたらと張り切るエミリー。", "zh": "伊织和春香来参加练习。另一份工作\n刚结束，她们说要从现在开始参加。星梨\n花和艾米莉对此很是佩服。几天后，大家\n聊起要在公演前一起想个特别的演出，艾\n米莉也格外干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "4e12d4ea3143d8d66d0468dd72e67354df9415076103383d128582cabe656f3e", "ja": "ふう、取材ってやっぱり肩がこるわね～……\nあら？　みんな、休憩中？", "zh": "呼，采访果然还是让肩膀很酸呢～……\n咦？大家在休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "8ae47772ff4a17203b27010642331b7e1077180fc9fca1599a640e6e29a4e88c", "ja": "伊織さま！　春香さん！", "zh": "伊织大人！春香小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5fbc921c016bffdebc2fc07b1a8fd8f644318367f43eab5ff550680f00f049bd", "ja": "伊織、春香、お疲れさま。\n取材、もう終わったのか？　早かったんだな。", "zh": "伊织，春香，辛苦了。\n采访已经结束了吗？挺快的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "dba57c35c0967aaebb83d24567977e65fb0064f3d627eff97e00a07dd1ea35cf", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nはい、無事終わりました♪　みんなも、お疲れさま！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n嗯，顺利结束了♪ 大家也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "eab305e2e0248322faba05b68b53b1ae0e470d20fc09b8c0a93a444016e90059", "ja": "春香、私たちも着替えてきましょ。", "zh": "春香，我们也去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8ca2afe92361beb5372a5782d77ad7acdc1e869d2f04ff142aa19b9d6e79e399", "ja": "え？　伊織、今からレッスンするのか？", "zh": "诶？伊织，你现在要去上课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "3eff3b2c82ec353412d9555b7a061d04a7e472c4c582660e7743a0ac91b940fe", "ja": "何言ってるのよ、当たり前じゃない。\n取材は終わったんだし、時間は有効活用しなくちゃ。", "zh": "你在说什么啊，这不是理所当然的吗？\n采访已经结束了，当然得有效利用时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "f958e4d63ced0091f678532ad19188264950551677c70a6f16ad3b334f2eefb9", "ja": "……エミリーちゃん。\n伊織さんは、やっぱりすごいね！", "zh": "……艾米莉。\n伊织小姐果然很厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "8170f74fd26e35b74133878c4e1dffdba844380e4a95b72aa5b0445c03be4927", "ja": "星梨花さん……はいっ！", "zh": "星梨花……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "d2427729277773459fc8a7f41d8838dd0f04a0e8e5509e8caae0df431a8ec4bd", "ja": "……？\nエミリー、星梨花、どうかしたの？", "zh": "……？\n艾米莉、星梨花，你们怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "6f0c72c22881ddb2963ec38d60166607d68297e25b813be6dc3ebfe9f5c205e9", "ja": "い、いえ！　なんでもありません！", "zh": "没、没什么！什么事也没有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "e599c51bfd4f138d8b8024b98a5df96bdfd2d8a89eae8f1c7a4f12b1a85a925d", "ja": "そう？\nま、いいわ。行きましょ、春香。", "zh": "是吗？  \n嘛，算了。走吧，春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "08cf9edc4472fc71196e4d194e8ed02367138952c97dc06cce851895e2f307a7", "ja": "あ、待ってよ伊織！", "zh": "啊，等等我，伊织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a7ca300845acb5ec8e0b87479684f9b79189e3e40172d4b6d3b26b195207d5cb", "ja": "ふふっ。\n……私たちも、準備しようか！", "zh": "呵呵。\n……我们也准备一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1018_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d84a08b71ceae8d33913aefa2e4a85753f37fe07204f5096b460e45b55cb53e5", "ja": "（今日も地方公演のレッスンだ。全員揃うと、\nみんなの気合いの入り方が違うな）", "zh": "（今天也是地方公演的练习。大家到齐后，所有人的干劲都不一样了啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "5b90ed5a020952ffbed25061d39cba6a1468250df8951a88f619058269f16273", "ja": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8！\n……うん、バッチリだね！", "zh": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8！\n……嗯，跳得很到位呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "a0099b96d3ecf28e88833430871e4a5bf91f09a94003acdabefa2fab6fb7f350", "ja": "いいじゃない、今の！\n全体曲の合わせは、もう完璧じゃないかしら？", "zh": "刚才那次不是挺好的嘛！\n合唱曲的配合，感觉已经很完美了不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "09f1b4f6da0175ddee0a405f7cbc45477f92ab61afca9ccd5ad07c1ef0d764fc", "ja": "Wow！　本当ですか！？\nたくさん練習した甲斐がありましたね、星梨花さん！", "zh": "哇！真的吗！？\n练习了这么多次总算有成果了呢，星梨花小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "5fc1cfea6a41ae2e588ca3a40850b3727f5eae8b492885f124975b1613ced6cb", "ja": "はい！\nがんばってよかったです、えへへ♪", "zh": "是的！\n努力果然没有白费，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "8129632c1de566490c8cdaba288329999944482b1d24b01fe0dc5d9593bcdb2e", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\n今度の地方公演のことなんだけど……。", "zh": "呐，{$P$}。\n关于下次的地方公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "1fc27f0191e2d0d20d488e1e99a3be45d63498f73ad156add9dbdaf27b2cd42e", "ja": "私たちのレッスンも順調だし、何か違う要素を\n取り入れてみるっていうのはどう？", "zh": "我们的排练也进展顺利，你觉得加入一些不同的元素试试怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "cb2261a1e72603f356888072e4cc9fae8f222db35fdcff90b59a9654bb28da4e", "ja": "違う要素？", "zh": "不同的元素？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "bffbc4e0dc78e9e50b29cd04284c25d0cac5e9b036a3433f701f416c883594f6", "ja": "ええ。ちょっと、思いついただけだけど……\nたとえば、地方公演ならではの演出を入れるとか。", "zh": "嗯。只是我稍微想到了一点……\n比如加入一些只有地方公演才有的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "b6c69ce49244a71195a9e225b9c948d311c3dac0438009c389bd6a4e611124c0", "ja": "お客さんは地元の人が多いと思うけど、\nこっちから遠征するファンのみんなもいるでしょ？", "zh": "我想客人里本地人会比较多，不过，也有从这边赶去参加演出的粉丝吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "218bd221fe8c3f6bf5a6accd9d24af3a4baa8174aecf69bd7da4f279d2302180", "ja": "そうだね。何か、地方だけの特別なものが見られたら、\nファンのみんなもうれしいかも……？", "zh": "是啊。要是能让大家看到一些只有当地才有的特别事物，粉丝们或许也会很开心……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1030_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c818b3ed9df2815175ae5759575d5d6a6c9c23c76846eb20e8114b400b12426d", "ja": "だったら、その地域の宣伝になるようなことが\nいいんじゃないかな？　MCなら、すぐにできるかも。", "zh": "既然这样，做些能为当地起到宣传作用的事情，不是更好吗？如果是MC的话，说不定马上就能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a81afb5f374615cf8c739b8fbedcc1799c54b3776f27e04e749c987620e8653e", "ja": "そうだな。MCはすぐにできるし、いいと思うけど……\n伊織、他に何か具体的なアイディアはあるか？", "zh": "是啊。MC马上就能做，我觉得挺好的，不过……\n伊织，你还有什么具体的想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "685d7203c81181dbb11ef7eb4ac152bfdad04fdce94da5e7e11d182f87b38795", "ja": "もう、そこから先を考えるのが、アンタの仕事でしょ！\n何でもかんでも、伊織ちゃんに頼らないでよね？", "zh": "接下来该怎么想，不就是你的工作吗！\n别什么事都依赖伊织啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "12aebf7f1665f55ba5c57967b5bb2c03058d9030ca3c851a52b932e2b6bac120", "ja": "はは、そうだな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "2932fa6861a259f963d4fd680a36a50ea74ab75b6979424ed173e092bf360d74", "ja": "ま、仕方がないから協力してあげてもいいけど。\nエミリー、何かあるかしら？", "zh": "没办法，我就帮你一下吧。艾米莉，你有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "c0e630d3fe7e436bf88f7608d780afb45531e56d972f7eb6a34d2959db012468", "ja": "えっ、わ、私ですか！？\nえ、ええと、ええと……。", "zh": "咦，啊、我吗！？\n那、那个，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "3f2b75d4a6936470316697f38fd29f061229034d8f636f06530a4134cf0cad27", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、がんばって！", "zh": "艾米莉，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "3a12d9bbdef9918da52d709fae38e1feb8b772c33450aa9c54e99a093032145a", "ja": "地域の宣伝になって……それでいて、ごヒイキ様方に\nよろこんでいただけるようなもの……うぅ～ん……。", "zh": "既能宣传当地……又能让各位主顾\n感到高兴的事物……嗯～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1038_032emi", "source_sha256": "619047b1b849c485a2ab41c1339d6d587ec5189e3c30cdfe35c7cca014bc51dd", "ja": "も、申し訳ありません……\nすぐには、思い浮かばなくて……。", "zh": "对、对不起……我没能马上想到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "f2e5e9a3872fb8c7cd1cedd08cafb50e81b82d56e653c7d5a7d4b22de00e288e", "ja": "あら、謝る必要ないわよ？　{$P$}が\n何も思いつかないなんて言うのが悪いんだし。", "zh": "哎呀，你用不着道歉啦？错的是{$P$}说什么毫无头绪嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "11bda775bbfcb18b6bda117ac984797ce4aab102222134fd6e0d27d5c92ceee8", "ja": "すまない……。", "zh": "抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1041_007ior", "source_sha256": "f34b7e8210826cc323f5b141609a4eecb9780ccb6c132fae121ed38d2901b7bd", "ja": "ねえ、みんなは？　何かいいアイディアはある？", "zh": "话说回来，大家呢？有什么好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1042_001har", "source_sha256": "31c935f4984ff5822ad910c2a0749cc09786baf90bb3131e3943ad9971b8ee71", "ja": "うーん。私も、すぐには思いつかないけど……。", "zh": "嗯……我也不是马上就能想到，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1043_022ser", "source_sha256": "22ea75de483a3cf0d0fb3d5c9f9332863bdad88857e99201969a1c5692a13a5b", "ja": "ファンのみなさんが、よろこんでくれるもの……\nわたしも、がんばって考えてみます！", "zh": "让粉丝们高兴的东西……\n我也会努力想想看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1044_007ior", "source_sha256": "3d975136f9679e9a5fa6aa81f6dd3a4db026f85df44e49231f2d3b5b2c67d273", "ja": "それじゃ、宿題にしましょ。次のレッスンまでに、\n何か思いついたら連絡すること！", "zh": "那么，就当作作业吧。在下次练习之前，要是想到了什么，记得联系我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "c51345b1ac58c5113190dc8a7cd1d64c1083a8d4515bb4407353e20ebe660218", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nすまないがみんな、協力してほしい。よろしく！", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n不好意思，大家请帮帮忙。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "45655448c6af835270c7afe604d429bdc9b3e76adbe7dbb2d4c018c154c32a91", "ja": "は、はい！　私も、がんばります！　二人組の\n相方として、必ずや伊織さまのお役に立ってみせます！", "zh": "是、是的！我也会加油的！作为两人组合的搭档，我一定会努力帮助伊织大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0150_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_04_1047_007ior", "source_sha256": "19cc6673c14c7c4f140fb21b488b1db0ddb833d27de48d7db8bcffbedd485434", "ja": "……？\nええ、よろしくね……？", "zh": "……？\n嗯，请多指教了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
